[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4887500354","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120973#issuecomment-4887500354","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120973","id":4887500354,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI1FWQg","user":{"login":"lostminds","id":17763524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYzNTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17763524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds","html_url":"https://github.com/lostminds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-05T20:32:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T20:32:29Z","body":"Got a report from another tester with what looks like the same issue on macOS 11.7.11 on an older Intel MacBook Pro as well, so it doesn't look like it's just on macOS 10.15.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4887500354/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4889874474","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120973#issuecomment-4889874474","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120973","id":4889874474,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI3WQKg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T06:46:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T06:46:10Z","body":"> According to [requirements](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/about/system_requirements.html#doc-system-requirements) oldest supported macOS for the Mobile renderer\n\nMin. version for current MoltenVK is 11.0, docs should be updated.\n\nThe issue might be already fixed in upstream by https://github.com/KhronosGroup/MoltenVK/pull/2758 and https://github.com/KhronosGroup/MoltenVK/pull/2733","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4889874474/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4890479481","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120973#issuecomment-4890479481","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120973","id":4890479481,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI37LeQ","user":{"login":"lostminds","id":17763524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYzNTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17763524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds","html_url":"https://github.com/lostminds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T08:04:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T08:07:37Z","body":"So this might actually be two different issues? One the new macOS 11 minimum requirement for Mobile/Forward+ projects the second that there are some issues with MoltenVK on older intel macs explaining why it still doesn't work in the second macOS 11 case?\n\nI thought the native Metal driver would be used on macOS as that's selected for the project, but I see now that isn't supported on intel macs so it's falling back to the Vulkan MoltenVK system.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4890479481/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4890564859","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120973#issuecomment-4890564859","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120973","id":4890564859,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI4AY-w","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T08:14:46Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T08:14:46Z","body":"> I thought the native Metal driver would be used on macOS as that's selected for the project\n\nNative Metal driver is supported only on Apple Silicon, it's not designed to take into account different GPUs on Intel Macs (and there are no plans to change it, since Apple will drop Intel support in next macOS).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4890564859/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4893791885","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120973#issuecomment-4893791885","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120973","id":4893791885,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI7FWjQ","user":{"login":"lostminds","id":17763524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYzNTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17763524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds","html_url":"https://github.com/lostminds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T14:12:30Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T14:12:30Z","body":"I'll update my low-end testing system to macOS 11 instead of 10.15 to reflect the new minimum requirements. Any idea of when the MoltenVK fixes mentioned above will be added into Godot so I can test to see if they do fix this issue? ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4893791885/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4894587237","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120973#issuecomment-4894587237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120973","id":4894587237,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI715ZQ","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T15:28:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T15:28:23Z","body":">  Any idea of when the MoltenVK fixes mentioned above will be added into Godot so I can test to see if they do fix this issue?\n\n[Vulkan SDK](https://vulkan.lunarg.com/sdk/home#mac) is usually released every few months, which would work for custom builds and CI + official build scripts should be updated. You can use a custom MoltenVK build with `vulkan_sdk_path` build argument. Building MoltenVK should be as simple as running `./fetchDependencies --macos` and `make macos`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4894587237/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4904243383","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120973#issuecomment-4904243383","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120973","id":4904243383,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJFDQtw","user":{"login":"lostminds","id":17763524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYzNTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17763524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds","html_url":"https://github.com/lostminds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-07T13:18:56Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T13:18:56Z","body":"After upgrading my low-end testing system 2013 Mac Pro to macOS 11.7.11 the project no longer crashes at launch, so I guess that was just a matter of the new minimum requirement being macOS 11 rather than 10.15. It would have been nice if this was communicated a little clearer (like a dialogue at startup rather than just crashing at launch), but this original issue then seems to be resolved now that I see the documentation has also been updated to reflect the new requirements.\n\nThe second issue with a crash on a different old intel MacBook Pro running macOS 11 may well be one of the MoltenVK bugs linked above based on the specific GPU that used. While they're not yet resolved in Godot I suppose they will when MoltenVK is eventually updated and this is integrated in Godot.\n\nSo maybe this issue can be closed? Or do you want to keep it open until the MoltenVK library update with these fixes is added in a future Godot update?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4904243383/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]